    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sketch Magician is a 2D action game where players fight using sketches as weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world of sketchbooks where you get lost, you control a stick figure wizard and defeat enemies by firing freely drawn pictures as attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a sketch battle like never before, where your strategy and creativity will be tested!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 How sketch magic works</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you sketch and decide the direction of the shot, the picture you drew will become an attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow-like attacks, shields to block enemy attacks, barriers to trap enemies... it's all up to your sketch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new sketch techniques and expand your strategy!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443350/extras/6c17f0a46b3a98a642688b50ede8b3b9.poster.avif?t=1740223163\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443350/extras/6c17f0a46b3a98a642688b50ede8b3b9.webm?t=1740223163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443350/extras/6c17f0a46b3a98a642688b50ede8b3b9.mp4?t=1740223163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Game progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you clear stages, more powerful enemies appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss battles require unique sketch tactics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, new skills will be unlocked and you will be able to draw more magic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy sketch battles in single player mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play VS mode with your friends in multiplayer mode. (To be added in an update!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sketch Magician is a 2D action game where players fight using sketches as weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world of sketchbooks where you get lost, you control a stick figure wizard and defeat enemies by firing freely drawn pictures as attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a sketch battle like never before, where your strategy and creativity will be tested!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 How sketch magic works</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you sketch and decide the direction of the shot, the picture you drew will become an attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arrow-like attacks, shields to block enemy attacks, barriers to trap enemies... it's all up to your sketch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new sketch techniques and expand your strategy!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443350/extras/6c17f0a46b3a98a642688b50ede8b3b9.poster.avif?t=1740223163\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443350/extras/6c17f0a46b3a98a642688b50ede8b3b9.webm?t=1740223163\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3443350/extras/6c17f0a46b3a98a642688b50ede8b3b9.mp4?t=1740223163\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Game progress</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you clear stages, more powerful enemies appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss battles require unique sketch tactics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, new skills will be unlocked and you will be able to draw more magic.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Game modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy sketch battles in single player mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play VS mode with your friends in multiplayer mode. (To be